{{Quote|Citizens, I present you with the latest vessel from Lothal's Imperial shipyards, the Sienar Systems Advanced TIE starfighter!|[[Maketh Tua]]'s speech at the 15th annual Empire Day parade|<ref name="Empire Day (episode)">{{Rebels|Empire Day (episode)}}</ref>}}
The '''Sienar Advanced Projects Laboratory''' (or '''APL''' for short) was a secret [[starfighter]] design and testing facility of [[Sienar Fleet Systems]]. It was located on [[Lothal]], whose relative obscurity and remoteness provided protection from [[Spy|spies]]. The APL's first prototype, the [[TIE/ad v1]], was unveiled at the [[Capital City]] [[Empire Day]] [[parade]] in [[5 BBY]].<ref name="NoP" />

